Fn-Nginx bundles an independently running NGINX Open Source binary.

NGINX version: 1.30.4 (stable)
Source archive: official nginx.org nginx-1.30.4 release
Source SHA-256: 4261dc90e9e47c1c4041276e9aaa3d48ebe2e664f728e14fa95ae6c67d57a08b
Core release tag: nginx-core-1.30.4-r1

Both Linux architectures are built from the same source archive with the same
Nginx configure arguments and static-linking policy. The builds use Alpine
Linux 3.21, GCC 14.2.0, musl libc 1.2.5, OpenSSL 3.3.7, PCRE 8.45 and zlib
1.3.2. No third-party Nginx module is included.

